1
00:00:00,044 --> 00:00:02,634
(Howard:)- What?
- Just whoa.

2
00:00:09,153 --> 00:00:11,523
(Bernadette:)Smells pretty ripe in here.

3
00:00:12,857 --> 00:00:15,557
You kind of feel it in your eyes.

4
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,790
(Leonard:)Raj, what's going on?

5
00:00:18,396 --> 00:00:21,266
(Raj:)I was humiliated by yet another woman.

6
00:00:21,432 --> 00:00:25,632
(Howard:)You didn't kill her and chop her up,
that's not what we're smelling, right?

7
00:00:25,803 --> 00:00:28,393
(Raj:)No, I took her for coffee...

8
00:00:28,572 --> 00:00:31,942
(Raj:)...and she snuck out the bathroom window
to get away from me.

9
00:00:32,109 --> 00:00:33,629
(Bernadette:)Oh, you poor baby.

10
00:00:33,811 --> 00:00:35,141
(Raj:)I went and looked.

11
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:37,302
(Raj:)It was a high and tiny window.

12
00:00:38,983 --> 00:00:41,313
She must've been very motivated.

13
00:00:42,219 --> 00:00:43,709
(Howard:)I'm sorry, that's awful.

14
00:00:43,888 --> 00:00:47,788
- But come on, you gotta shake it off.
- You can't stay in your apartment...

15
00:00:47,958 --> 00:00:50,488
(Leonard:)...for the rest of your life.
- Why not?

16
00:00:50,694 --> 00:00:54,134
(Raj:)With online shopping and overnight
delivery, I can get anything I want.

17
00:00:54,832 --> 00:00:58,322
(Raj:)Look, I just ordered a case
of Dinty Moore beef stew...

18
00:00:58,502 --> 00:01:01,472
(Raj:)...and two live lobsters on Amazon.

